  "title": "epan: Add a size check",
  "description": "Fix\n\n    *** CID 1659008:         Integer handling issues  (INTEGER_OVERFLOW)\n    /builds/wireshark/wireshark/epan/proto.c: 9998             in mark_truncated()\n    9992     \t\t\t*value_pos -= 1;\n    9993     \t\t}\n    9994     \t}\n    9995\n    9996     \t/* Check if value_pos is past label_str. */\n    9997     \tif (value_pos && *value_pos >= size) {\n    >>>     CID 1659008:         Integer handling issues  (INTEGER_OVERFLOW)\n    >>>     Expression \"size - 1UL\", where \"size\" is known to be equal to 0, underflows the type of \"size - 1UL\", which is type \"unsigned long\".\n    9998     \t\t*value_pos = size - 1;\n    9999     \t}\n    10000     }\n    10001\n    10002     static void\n    10003     label_mark_truncated(char *label_str, size_t name_pos, size_t *value_pos)",
  "state": "merged",
